<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-FRANCE V ITALY DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE V ITALY DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NANTES, France 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of a Davis Cup tennis World Group semifinal on Sunday:</p>
<p>France and Italy level at 2-2 </p>
<p>Results (French names first):</p>
<p>Cedric Pioline beat Renzo Furlan 6-3 2-6 6-2 6-4  </p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch beat Andrea Gaudenzi 6-4 6-2 7-6 (10-8)</p>
<p>France won 3-2 and will meet Sweden in the final.</p>
</text>
